# Automatically identify and compile all the source files in the project directory.
# DO NOT explicitly list files/directories in 'dvt_init_auto' sections. Use 'dvt_init' sections instead.
#+dvt_init_auto

# ==============================================================================
# DVT Eclipse IDE Build Configuration File
# This file tells the DVT parser how to compile your SV/UVM project.
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Initialize built-in UVM support (Crucial for UVM autocomplete)
+dvt_init+xcelium.xrun

# Include UVM (Cadence version 1.2)B
+dvt_setenv+EM_DK_SITE=/projdk/oa_design_kits_cadence
#+dvt_setenv+WORK_ROOT=/work/dku/RNM_testbench/src
-uvm
-uvmhome CDNS-1.2

# 2. Global compiler directives (Matches your xrun setup)
+define+ENABLE_SPICE

# 3. Include directories
# Tells DVT where to look when it sees `include "my_first_test.sv"
+incdir+RNM_model/src/sv
+incdir+RNM_testbench/src/tb
+incdir+RNM_testbench/src/uvc
+incdir+RNM_testbench/src/tests

# 4. Source Files (Compiled in order)
# Note: Always compile packages first!
RNM_model/src/sv/udn_pkg.sv
RNM_testbench/src/uvc/comp_uvc_pkg.sv
RNM_testbench/src/tests/comp_test_pkg.sv
# Design files
RNM_model/src/sv/comparator_RNM.sv

# Verification / Testbench files
# Make sure to list the new files we just created!
RNM_testbench/src/tb/test_dut.sv
RNM_testbench/src/uvc/comp_if.sv

# We only need to compile tb_top.sv directly if it `includes the test files
# inside of it. If it doesn't, uncomment the specific test files below:
# src/tb/my_first_test.sv
RNM_testbench/src/tb/tb_top.sv

-top tb_top